<title>UK: BET purchase helps buoy Rentokil sales.</title>
<headline>BET purchase helps buoy Rentokil sales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Business services group Rentokil Initial Plc announced a strong rise in 1996 profits and sales on Wednesday as a result of Rentokil's acquisition last year of rival BET.</p>
<p>The group said pre-tax profit soared 48 percent to 318 million pounds while sales were 167 percent higher at 2.34 billion pounds. The company, whose results include eight months of contribution from BET, also announced a two-for one share split.</p>
</text>
